  Taken from the widget's own embedded markup rather than approximated with a unicode
  ornament, which is what the earlier version did — and unicode ornaments fall back to colour
  emoji on Windows and Android, which is exactly how it looked wrong.

  Usage: {% render 'lp-laurel', side: 'left' %} | 'right' | 'caduceus'
{%- endcomment -%}

